---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Events" description="Conferences, lectures, workshops, and courses.">
  <div class="page-wrapper">
    <div class="content-wrapper">

      <div class="dossier-header">
        <span class="uppercase faded">Travel Log</span>
        <h1>Events</h1>
        <p class="faded small">Conferences, lectures, workshops, and courses across four continents.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ORGANIZATION -->
      <div class="section-label reveal">Organization</div>

      <p class="reveal">
        Organized several editions of the <a href="https://escoladedados.org/coda/">Brazilian Conference on Data Journalism and Digital Methods (Coda.Br)</a>
        from 2018 to 2022, including the first regional meeting in the Amazon region. Collaborated with
        <a href="https://witness.org/">Witness</a> to organize the first national meeting on deepfakes and developed a series of events about free culture and piracy (Copyfight).
      </p>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2022</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Belém, Brazil</div>
            <div><a href="https://escoladedados.org/coda/coda-amazonia/"><strong>Coda Amazônia</strong></a>. 1st ed.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2021</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Online</div>
            <div><a href="https://escoladedados.org/coda/coda2021/"><strong>Coda.Br</strong></a>. 6th ed.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2020</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Online</div>
            <div><a href="https://escoladedados.org/coda/coda2020/"><strong>Coda.Br</strong></a>. 5th ed.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2019</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">São Paulo, Brazil</div>
            <div><a href="https://lab.witness.org/brasil-deepfakes-prepara-se-agora/"><strong>Deepfakes — prepare-se agora</strong></a>. 1st ed.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:0.5rem"><a href="https://escoladedados.org/coda/coda2019/"><strong>Coda.Br</strong></a>. 4th ed.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2018</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">São Paulo, Brazil</div>
            <div><a href="https://escoladedados.org/coda/coda2018/"><strong>Coda.Br</strong></a>. 3rd ed.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2010–14</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Rio de Janeiro, Brazil</div>
            <div><strong>Copyfight</strong>. 3 editions (2010, 2011, 2014).</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TALKS -->
      <div class="section-label reveal">Talks & Lectures</div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2025</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Bergen, Norway</div>
            <div><a href="https://belisario.website/crossfire_paper"><strong>Into the Crossfire: Evaluating the Use of a Language Model to Crowdsource Gun Violence Reports</strong></a>. ACM CSCW.</div>
            <div class="timeline-location" style="margin-top:0.75rem">Niterói, Brazil</div>
            <div><strong>Cross-platform gendertrolling</strong>. Association of Internet Researchers Conference.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2024</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Berlin, Germany</div>
            <div><strong>Way beyond ChatGPT: leveraging open source language models</strong>. Global Innovation Gathering.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:0.5rem"><a href="https://re-publica.com/de/session/laughs-courts-multifaceted-uses-ai-global-south"><strong>From Laughs to Courts: Multifaceted Uses of AI in the Global South</strong></a>. re:publica 2024.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:0.5rem"><a href="https://belisards.github.io/slides-bert-fact-checking/"><strong>AI uses for fact-checking in Brazil</strong></a>. DW Akademy.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2021</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Online</div>
            <div><a href="https://visualinvestigations.netlify.app/"><strong>Anatomy of a visual investigation</strong></a>. RightsCon.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2019</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Salvador, Brazil</div>
            <div><a href="https://medialabufrj.net/blog/2019/06/dobras-35-medialab-ufrj-no-simposio-lavits-2019/"><strong>Expulsão/Exceção: arquitetura forense</strong></a>. LAVITS 2019.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2017</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Berlin, Germany</div>
            <div><strong>Coolab — Community networks in Brazil</strong>. re:publica.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2014</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Berlin, Germany</div>
            <div><strong>Micropolitics of the Post-Digital</strong>. Transmediale.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2013</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Geneva, Switzerland</div>
            <div><strong>Data driven campaigning</strong>. Open Knowledge Conference.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- LABS -->
      <div class="section-label reveal">Labs</div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2017</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Madrid, Spain</div>
            <div><strong>Agrega.la</strong>. Visualizar17 — Medialab Prado.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2016</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Cartagena, Colombia & Mexico City, Mexico</div>
            <div><strong>Agrega.la / Caixa Mágica</strong>. LABIC / Openlabs.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- WORKSHOPS -->
      <div class="section-label reveal">Workshops</div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2025</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">São Paulo, Brazil</div>
            <div><a href="https://belisario.website/classificacao_ia/"><strong>Classificação de textos e imagens com IA de código-aberto</strong></a>. ABRAJI.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2024</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">Brasília, Brazil</div>
            <div><a href="https://bit.ly/ia-coda-24/"><strong>Texto, áudio e imagens: usando modelos de IA gratuitos</strong></a>. América Aberta/Coda.Br.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-entry reveal">
          <div class="timeline-date"><span class="stamp">2023</span></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <div class="timeline-location">São Paulo, Brazil</div>
            <div><a href="https://escoladedados.org/coda/coda2023/entendendo-e-usando-transformers-a-tecnologia-por-tras-do-chatgpt/"><strong>Entendendo e usando Transformers</strong></a>. Coda.Br.</div>
            <div class="timeline-location" style="margin-top:0.75rem">Geneva, Switzerland</div>
            <div><a href="https://github.com/belisards/intro_nlp_ddj"><strong>Beyond the hype: an introduction to NLP and language models</strong></a>. European Data and Computational Journalism Conference.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .dossier-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .dossier-header h1 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* --- Timeline --- */
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 60px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .timeline-entry {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline-entry::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 56px;
    top: 1.35rem;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    background: var(--red-stamp);
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .timeline-date {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 45px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .timeline-date .stamp {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    transform: none;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .timeline-location {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--ink-faded);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .timeline::before {
      left: 10px;
    }

    .timeline-entry {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding-left: 2rem;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .timeline-entry::before {
      left: 6px;
      top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .timeline-date {
      text-align: left;
      width: auto;
    }

    .timeline-content {
      padding-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
